## Object-table walk (the &lt;2s core)

```
game_plugin.base + tableRva     → offset table base
table + SLOT                    → slotPtr
slotPtr + 0x80                  → vector descriptor
read U64 begin, U64 end         → pointer array
count = (end - begin) / 8
classify person rows by vtable (Player / Staff / PlayerStaff / HumanManager)
```

**Patch resilience:** maintain build→`tableRva` map; if stale, **score-scan** for a table whose slot counts look sane (continents≈7, regions≈28, people 30k–120k, teams 30k–90k, clubs 10k–50k, …). Pattern from fm-ai-assistent `FmOffsets` (Windows + Linux / Proton same layout).

FMLE often needs online after SI patches (remote offsets). Local RVA map + signature fallback avoids that tax if kept current.

